# abc-harness-stmap-advanced

This workspace was scaffolded by `AutoEDA`.

## Layout

- `project_pack/`: user-provided mission, policy, skills, evaluation, git, and supervisor config
- `runtime/`: campaign state, canonical version log, runtime logs, and results

## First Steps

1. Fill in `project_pack/mission.md`
2. Tighten `project_pack/agent.md`
3. Fill the three skill categories under `project_pack/skills/`
4. Review `project_pack/evaluation.yaml`
5. Review `project_pack/git.yaml`
6. Review `project_pack/secrets.ref`
7. Run `python3 -m autoeda validate-pack --workspace .`
8. Run `python3 -m autoeda preflight --workspace .`
9. Run `python3 -m autoeda launch --workspace . --canary`

